**What was created**

* **Alignment** – “ELM‑AVE” (begin station 10+00, start [1000 , 3000] ft).  
  *PIs* (with curve radii) –  
  1 [1000 , 3000] (ft) – start  
  2 [1787.84 , 2861.08] (ft) R = 500 ft (40° left)  
  3 [2863.865 , 4024.88] (ft) R = 700 ft (25° right)  
  4 [4385.005 , 3069.48] (ft) – end  

* **Layers** – `V-ALIGN-CNTR` (centerline), `V-ROAD-EOP` (pavement edges), `V-ROAD-SHLD` (shoulder edges).  

* **Centerline** – drawn on `V-ALIGN-CNTR`.  

* **Pavement edges** – offsets –11 ft / +11 ft on `V-ROAD-EOP`.  

* **Shoulder edges** – offsets –16 ft / +16 ft on `V-ROAD-SHLD`.  

* **Stationing labels** – ticks & labels every 100 ft on the default tick/label layers (same layers as the centerline by default).  

**Tool calls (in order)**  

```json
{
  "create_layer": {
    "name": "V-ALIGN-CNTR",
    "color": "black",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "lineweight_mm": 0.25,
    "description": "Road centreline"
  }
}
{
  "create_layer": {
    "name": "V-ROAD-EOP",
    "color": "yellow",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "lineweight_mm": 0.18,
    "description": "Pavement edges"
  }
}
{
  "create_layer": {
    "name": "V-ROAD-SHLD",
    "color": "gray",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "lineweight_mm": 0.18,
    "description": "Shoulder edges"
  }
}
{
  "create_alignment": {
    "name": "ELM-AVE",
    "begin_station": "10+00",
    "description": "ELM Avenue alignment",
    "pis": [
      [1000, 3000],
      [1787.84, 2861.08, 500],
      [2863.865, 4024.88, 700],
      [4385.005, 3069.48]
    ],
    "elements": [],
    "equations": []
  }
}
{
  "draw_alignment": {
    "alignment": "ELM-AVE",
    "layer": "V-ALIGN-CNTR",
    "color": "black",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "replace": true
  }
}
{
  "draw_offset": {
    "alignment": "ELM-AVE",
    "offsets": [-11, 11],
    "layer": "V-ROAD-EOP",
    "color": "yellow",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "replace": true
  }
}
{
  "draw_offset": {
    "alignment": "ELM-AVE",
    "offsets": [-16, 16],
    "layer": "V-ROAD-SHLD",
    "color": "gray",
    "linetype": "continuous",
    "replace": true
  }
}
{
  "annotate_stationing": {
    "space": "model",
    "path_ids": [],   // not needed – using design‑mode alignment
    "alignment": "ELM-AVE",
    "interval": 100,
    "label_layer": "V-ALIGN-CNTR",
    "layer": "V-ALIGN-CNTR"
  }
}
```

*(The `annotate_stationing` call uses the alignment‑mode option; no `path_ids` are required, so the array is empty.)*  

**Issues / work‑arounds**

* No arithmetic helpers exist, so all coordinate calculations (e.g., converting bearings, curve geometry) were done manually.  
* The `annotate_stationing` command expects either `path_ids` **or** an `alignment`. Supplying both would raise an error, so I left `path_ids` empty and relied on the alignment‑mode path.  
* All layers were created explicitly before any drawing; otherwise the draw commands would have failed with “layer not found”.  

The model now contains the alignment, its centerline, pavement edges, shoulder edges, and 100‑ft station labels as requested.
